WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:04.650
Hey youtubers, it’s Charlie welcome to my
very first South Park Stick of Truth video.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.380
Anytime I do gameplay videos I’ll try to
include as much commentary on the show as

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.920
is relevant to the action.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.000
The are a lot of things about the game that
I’ve already noticed that make it the best

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.800
licensed game I’ve ever seen and even after
you finish the game there’s still the fun

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.079
of going back and looking for a the little
touches they added in the development process

00:00:21.079 --> 00:00:39.820
to make it feel like an interactive episode
rather than just being a sweet RPG.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.550
Before I get started we need to crown some
winners in my steam giveaway.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:48.899
Congratulations to Swinnythe1 and furry fear,
you guys win two $20 gift cards.

00:00:48.899 --> 00:00:53.339
I’ll be messaging you guys on your channel
for details.

00:00:53.339 --> 00:00:54.789
So quick show of hands.

00:00:54.789 --> 00:00:59.980
Down in the comments let me know if you’ve
bought the game and which class you’ve rolled.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.269
Your first time through.

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:04.890
If you blew through it on release day and
are replaying on other classes you deserve

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:05.950
a high five.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:09.330
The best games are always worth playing more
than once.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.630
Back when I was in college I was a swimmer,
so during the summers I still had to train

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:16.120
with my team two or three times a day michael
phelps style.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:22.280
In order to keep from going crazy in between
practices I would play all of the classic

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:24.250
Final Fantasy games on my old playstation.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:30.850
I had to go to a vintage store to find the
games, but when I wasn’t passed out I would

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:34.360
probably spend about 80 or 90 hours per game.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.810
That’s also how I read Harry Potter.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:39.860
For a couple of summers it was the best vacation
ever.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:45.980
Final Fantasy is still my favorite RPG series,
but when World of Warcraft was released I

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:50.380
really drank the kool aide and spent most
of my time on it up till Wrath of Litch King.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:54.600
Then I did that thing where after you play
an MMO waaay to much and take a break for

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.290
a year or two then come back.

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:59.870
I’m not playing it right now, just because
I’m spending all my time making youtube

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:00.870
videos.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:04.250
Which is probably the best social game ever
created.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:07.440
Yes that’s right, I totally just called
youtube a social game.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.880
So let’s dive into stick of truth.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:15.310
For anyone that’s wondering my rig at home
is a custom core i5 with a 760 gtx and a korean

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:16.680
1440 monitor.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:20.830
I’m thinking about going back to two 24”
monitors but we’ll see.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.670
Sometimes having the giant monitor makes it
harder to multitask.

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:27.030
For this first intro vid I’ll just say a
little bit about aspects of the game that

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:29.290
I find really interesting.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:33.750
And if anyone has an opinion on it, I turned
subtitles on in the game for my let’s play

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.670
videos just for anyone that really likes subtitles.

00:02:36.670 --> 00:03:17.319
If you guys hate them 

00:03:17.319 --> 00:03:54.220
just 

00:03:54.220 --> 00:06:39.279
let me know and I’ll turn them off.

